# jq engine import

This directory contains the jq engine snapshot from commit
`a829f678f340da83a75fb35457d918c98524fdc7`.

Boundary:

- `src/vendor/jq/` owns imported jq engine code and generated parser sources.
- `src/lib/jq/` owns bx runtime adapters used by the engine.
- `src/applets/text/jq/` owns CLI parsing, compatibility defaults, help,
  diagnostics, and exit policy.

The imported jq `main.c` is intentionally absent. bx links the engine and
adapter libraries directly into the multicall executable and enters through
`bx_jq_main()` and `bx_jq_cli_main()`. There is no external jq process and no
preprocessor renaming of `main`.

Local engine patches are pinned by the jq allocation, JSON-parser, filter
recursion, and regex policy audits in `bx-tests`.
